    - Term: PrivacyPolicy.Description
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - 'For more info on our privacy policy, open a browser with this link: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Für mehr Infos zu unseren Datenschutzbestimmungen öffne den folgenden Link in einem Browser: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Подробнее о нашей политике конфиденциальности: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'لمزيد من المعلومات حول سياسة الخصوصية الخاصة بنا، افتح هذا الرابط في متصفح: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Pour davantage d''informations sur notre politique de confidentialité, ouvre un navigateur avec ce lien : www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Pour en savoir plus sur notre politique de confidentialité, consulte ce lien dans un navigateur : www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Per ulteriori informazioni riguardo alla nostra politica sulla privacy, vai a questo link: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Para obtener más información acerca de nuestra política de privacidad, abre este enlace en un navegador de Internet: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Para obter mais informações sobre nossa política de privacidade, abra este link em um navegador: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'Voor meer informatie over ons privacybeleid open je deze koppeling in een browser: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 有关我们的隐私政策的更多信息，请在浏览器中访问此链接：www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy
      - 若要了解更多隱私權政策的資訊，請在瀏覽器中打開此連結：www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy
      - プライバシー・ポリシーについての詳細は、このリンクをブラウザで開いてください。www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy
      - 개인정보 처리방침의 자세한 정보를 확인하려면 브라우저에서 다음 링크를 열어보세요. www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy
      - 'Gizlilik politikamız hakkında daha fazla bilgi için tarayıcınızda bu bağlantıyı açın: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
      - 'For more info on our privacy policy, open this link: www.paladinstudios.com/CTRPrivacy'
