    - Term: Tutorials.Chapter05_Level05_Text1
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Objects are carried along by the magic path
      - Der Magische Weg befördert die Gegenstände
      - Предметы перемещаются по волшебному пути
      - تنقل الكائنات من خلال المسار السحري
      - Les objets sont transportés par le chemin magique
      - Les objets sont transportés par le sentier magique.
      - Gli oggetti vengono trasportati lungo il sentiero magico
      - El camino mágico arrastra los objetos
      - Os objetos são conduzidos pelo caminho mágico
      - Objecten worden meegenomen langs het magische pad
      - 物体沿魔法路线移动前行
      - 物品會沿著魔法路線被帶動
      - アイテムは魔法の小道に沿って運ばれるよ
      - 물체가 마법의 길을 따라 이동합니다
      - Nesneler sihir yolu boyunca taşınır
      - Objects are carried along by the magic path
      Flags: 00000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
